d-4c79-9c2b-91c0b0efa29d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8a0b05a4-1d0d-4c79-9c2b-91c0b0efa29d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a table in the central chamber of the <a href=\"/wiki/Grand_Mausoleum\" title=\"Grand Mausoleum\">Grand Mausoleum</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-280&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-867</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A hand-drawn map shows the Gauntlet of Shar. Its labyrinthian tangle of chambers and passageways stretch across multiple levels, with a vast statue of Shar dominating the central hall. Here and there are asides written in a jagged, spidery hand - Balthazar's exploratory notes.] \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Intact wing - proving grounds? \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Ruined wing - something present there. Strange sounds reported. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Rats. Why so many damnable rats???\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234335\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1611/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28556/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7074/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936228/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.134      1 Template:MiscIt